pngtalk is written from scratch. No code from the projects below is included; their published behaviour
and documentation shaped it:

- LivLiv Player (https://github.com/livliv-dev/player, Apache-2.0): the PNGTuber picture set (mouth closed,
  mouth open, and eyes-closed versions), a mouth driven by voice loudness, idle breathing and blinking.
- Digital Human Koubo (https://github.com/andyhuo520/digital-human-koubo, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026
  Berryxia (andyhuo520)): the talking-head packaging step: voice clean-up, captions in the lower third,
  a title, vertical 9:16 delivery.
